<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USAir raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USAir raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said analyst Susan Donofrio upgraded USAir Group Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- believes &quot;management and labor are finally getting on board to change USAir from a carrier of convenience to a carrier of choice.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares were unchanged at 20-5/8.</p>
</text>
